WEBVTT

NOTE
The Timber train mission — the SeeD team's train pursuing President Deling's train.
Duration: approximately 26 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Close-up of the presidential train exterior — ornate dark green cars with gold filigree race through forest.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
The SeeD team's gray train with a red stripe closes in on the presidential train from behind.

00:16.000 --> 00:26.000
The two trains run parallel on adjacent tracks, the gray SeeD train pulling alongside the presidential cars.
